    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>User Guide no cap</label><div><h5>Overview no cap</h5><ul><li>Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news. no cap</li><li>All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage). no cap</li></ul><h5>Shortcuts no cap</h5><ul><li>Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette no cap</li><li>1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing) no cap</li><li>/ : focus search (also via palette) no cap</li><li>Enter in search: start search no cap</li><li>ESC: close modals no cap</li><li>Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites no cap</li><li>Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock no cap</li></ul><h5>Search & Autocomplete no cap</h5><ul><li>Bangs:  no cap!g  no cap!ddg  no cap!bing  no cap!yt  no cap!wiki  no cap!maps</li><li>Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings;  no cap{q} as placeholder no cap</li><li>Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset) no cap</li><li>Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search no cap</li></ul><h5>Tiles no cap</h5><ul><li>Drag & drop to sort, click to open no cap</li><li>+ Tile: add a new favorite no cap</li><li>Reset: restore default favorites no cap</li></ul><h5>Widgets & Layout no cap</h5><ul><li>Visibility per widget no cap</li><li>Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal) no cap</li><li>Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults no cap</li><li>Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card no cap</li></ul><h5>Background no cap</h5><ul><li>Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval) no cap</li><li>Accent color is extracted from the active background no cap</li></ul><h5>Data no cap</h5><ul><li>Export/Import as JSON no cap</li><li>Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo) no cap</li></ul></div></div>"
